  "notes": "{尽|つ}くす means to exhaust completely or to devote oneself wholeheartedly.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{尽|つ}きる→尽きる：12365_tsukiru⟧ (intransitive, to be exhausted)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{力|ちから}→力：01661_chikara⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{尽|つ}くす: to exert all one's effort\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{尽|つ}くす: to try every means\n- ⟦{全力|ぜんりょく}→全力：11637_zenryoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{尽|つ}くす: to give one's all\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{尽|つ}くす: to devote oneself to someone\n\nAUXILIARY USE:\nVerb stem + {尽|つ}くす means \"to do completely\":\n- ⟦{言|い}い{尽|つ}くす→言い尽くす：27812_iitsukusu⟧: to say everything\n- ⟦{使|つか}い{尽|つ}くす→使い尽くす：27813_tsukaitsukusu⟧: to use up completely\n\nRELATED:\n- ⟦{尽|つ}きる→尽きる：12365_tsukiru⟧: to run out, be exhausted",
